  "description": "AI visibility for Umbraco — request log + dashboard, robots.txt audit, content negotiation, llms.txt manifests, and *.md page rendering. Auto-generates per-page Markdown at {url}.md, /llms.txt, and /llms-full.txt; surfaces an AI Traffic dashboard so editors can see who's reading the site; audits robots.txt against the AI-crawler list. Built for Umbraco v17+.",
